You are free to share and adapt this material for any purpose, including commercially, under
one condition: give appropriate credit, provide a link to the licence, and indicate if changes
were made.

Credit means naming Kynth Studios, the index product that made the measurement, and the cut date
of the file you used. Every dataset directory carries a citation line ready to paste, and every
row set carries the cut date in its filename.

The measurement method these datasets share is published at https://toolproof.kynth.studio/methodology.
